  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math> and <math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>multiply and divide by <math><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></math> and equate imaginary part</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math></p>",
